{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22909","headline":"携诸山客同上香炉峰遇雨而还沾濡狼籍互相笑谑题此解嘲 · 白居易","name":"携诸山客同上香炉峰遇雨而还沾濡狼籍互相笑谑题此解嘲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"萧洒登山去，龙锺遇雨回。\n磴危攀薜荔，石滑践莓苔。\n韤污君相谑，鞵穿我自咍。\n莫欺泥土脚，曾蹋玉阶来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22909.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22909","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}